There is always at least one Priestess in the game; in the Gnomish town.  
The thing to do is to find an *unaligned* Priestess, get all the $ you can 
(and Ludios is the place to go), donate it to her piecemeal, and then kill 
her.  This will usually result in the loss of an intrinsic by the way and 
will do your luck no good, but it is worth it because she will be carrying 
all the gold.  Salvage this and go and find the next unaligned priestess.  
Repeat until all unaligned priestesses are dead, then finally give it to an 
aligned one (which you don't want to kill of course).  This procedure does 
great things for your AC.

The best strategies for Fort Ludios are:

	Wield that cockatrice corpse (carefully!)
	Be a strong valkyrie with Mjollnir
	Get a wand of death and the blessed PYEC
	Polymorph; vampire lords are good for this with their abilities
		including the ability to levitate over water.

